<PARA INFOID = "T010054A074" UPDATE = "ORIGINAL" LDUP = "25Sep2003"     INFOTYPE = "SYSTEM" INDSW = "ON">
<TITLE>Cooling Fan System</TITLE>
<LIST1 TYPE = "UNORDERED"><ITEM><PTXT>The speed of the 2 cooling fan motors is switched in 2 stages according to the coolant temperature and air conditioner operating status.</PTXT></ITEM>
<ITEM><PTXT>The 2 motors are connected in series (6V) at Lo and in parallel (12V) at Hi.</PTXT></ITEM>
<ITEM><PTXT>A system in which the engine control computer directly controls relay ON/OFF has been adopted.</PTXT></ITEM></LIST1>
